  <!-- Notation stave (P1) over a TAB stave (P2), formatted together so same-tick notes
       line up. Each TAB note carries a words direction of a different width. The text is
       centered on its note's column, so every word sits under the notehead and over the
       fret regardless of how long it is — a left-anchored word drifts right by half its
       own width, which a varying-width row makes obvious. -->
